\begin{lem}[{\cite[Lemmas 5.4 and 5.5]{Saito2015}}]\label{lem:4.5}
Assume that $0<\varepsilon<\pi/2$, $1<q<\infty$ and the constants $\lambda_0$, $\mu_{-},$ $\gamma_{1-}>0.$ Let the set $\Gamma_{\ep,\lambda_0}$ be defined by \eqref{def:Gamma} for some $\delta_0>0,$ and let the multiplier $m_1(\lambda,\xi')\in \bM_{-2,2}(\widetilde{\Gamma}_{\varepsilon,\lambda_0})$
