Notice that the pushout in the middle of that diagram, i.e., the act $A \cup (\mathfrak{N}_{\alpha+1} \cap B)$, is identical to the pushout in the diagram $\mathcal{D}^{f,\mathfrak{N}_{\alpha+1}}$.  So $\tau^{\alpha+1}$ is the same inclusion as $r^{f,\mathfrak{N}_{\alpha+1}}$.

