\[
f \restriction \mathfrak{N}_{\text{cf}(\lambda)} = f \text{ and } r^{f,\mathfrak{N}_{\text{cf}(\lambda)}} = \text{id}_B
\]
because $B \subset \mathfrak{N}_{\text{cf}(\lambda)}$.  Hence, $f$ can be viewed as the composition 
\[
