\title{\textbf{Non-Discriminatory Personalized Pricing}\thanks{We thank Dirk Bergemann, Ben Brooks, Laura Doval, Yingni Guo, Elliot Lipnowski, Ellen Muir, Harry Pei, Alessandro Pavan, Jacopo Perego, Benjamin Polak, Phil Reny, Vasiliki Skreta, Alex Smolin, Rakesh Vohra, Jonas von Wangenheim, Frank Yang, Jidong Zhou, and various seminar audience, for their valuable comments and suggestions. We also thank Tsong-Hong Tenn for his research assistance. All errors are our own.}}
