||(u-k)_{-}||_{W^{1,1}(K_{r}(y))} \leqslant \mathcal{K}\,k\,r^{N-1},\,\,\,\,\,\,and\,\,\,\,\,\, |\{K_{r}(y) : u\geqslant k \}|\geqslant \beta |K_{r}(y)|,
