|\{K_{\bar{r}}(\bar{x}):  u\geqslant \xi\,k \}| \geqslant (1-\nu) |K_{\bar{r}}(y)|,\,\,\, \bar{r}:=\delta \beta^{2}\frac{(1-\xi)\nu}{\mathcal{K}}\,r.
