\title{Choquet rating criteria, risk measures, and risk consistency}
\author{  Nan Guo\thanks{China Bond Rating Company, China.   \texttt{abraham.guo@qq.com}}\and Ruodu Wang\thanks{Department of Statistics and Actuarial Science, University of Waterloo, Canada.   \texttt{wang@uwaterloo.ca}}\and Chenxi Xia\thanks{School of Mathematical Sciences, Peking University, China. \texttt{xiacx@pku.edu.cn}}\and Jingping Yang\thanks{School of Mathematical Sciences, Peking University, China.
