$r(S_t,A_t)$ with 
$Q^{\pi}(S_t,A_t)-\gamma\mathbb{E}_{{S_{t+1}\sim p(\cdot\vert S_t,A_t), a^\prime\sim\pi(\cdot|S_{t+1})}}[Q^{\pi}(S_{t+1},a^\prime)]$ using the Bellman equation.

