Together with the condition that $L \ll \sqrt{n T} / \log (n T)$ and $L^{2 p / d} \gg n T\left\{1+\left\|\int_{s} \boldsymbol{U}(s) \mathbb{G}(d s)\right\|_{2}^{-2}\right\}$, we obtain 
