\section{Methodology}

In this project, we will communicate from one STM32F103C8T6 to another STM32F103C8T6 through the HC-05 bluetooth module. The green house is in a master mood. The Green house is collecting the data and showing the data on his own screen and sending these data simultaneously to the Red house.

