%requirement35.mcf
If the barrier is instructed to do a \formula{do\_endStopOpening}, it is open. 
\end{requirement}
%------------------- 
\begin{requirement}{safreq36}{End stop closing barrier only if the barrier is closed}
%requirement36.mcf
If the barrier is instructed to do an \formula{do\_endStopClosing}, it is closed. 
\end{requirement}
