To see this, denote $m=|I|$ and let $k$ be as above. Choose $v\in \mathcal{D}(\mathbbm{1}, X^{\otimes m+k})$, so that $v^{\dagger}\circ v=1_{\mathbbm{1}}$. Set

$$b= v\otimes 1_{k+2m}\otimes v^{\dagger}\in \mathcal{D}(X^{3m+2k},X^{3m+2k})=B_{I^{+(m+k)}}.$$

