\begin{abstract} 
In this paper, we prove a trace inequality
$\Tr\left[ f(A) A^s B^s \right]
\leq 
\Tr\big[ f(A) (A^{1/2} B A^{1/2} )^s \big]$ for any positive and monotone increasing function $f$, $s\in[0,1]$, and positive semi-definite matrices $A$ and $B$.
On the other hand, for $s\in[0,1]$ such that the map $x\mapsto x^s g(x)$ is positive and decreasing, then 
$
\Tr\big[ g(A) (A^{1/2} B A^{1/2} )^s \big]
\leq 
\Tr\left[ g(A) A^s B^s \right]$.
\end{abstract}

