\subsection{Visualization of Decision Boundaries}

Figures \ref{fig:blobs}, \ref{fig:circles}, \ref{fig:spiral}, and \ref{fig:moons} show decision boundaries of each classifier for the Blobs, Circles, Spiral, and Moons datasets, respectively. For the Entropic classifiers, the uncertainty bands (between $H_d$ and $H_g$ as in \eqref{eq:bounds}) are included as dashed lines.

