\caption{Band evolution at 2$^{nd}$ BZ.
(a), Illustration of $\alpha_1$, $\alpha_2$, and $\beta$ Fermi surface sheets in the 2$^{nd}$ BZ.
(b)-(e), Photoemission intensity showing band dispersion of $\alpha_1$, $\alpha_2$, and $\beta$ from nodal to antinodal regions [cuts~\#7-\#10 in panel (a)], respectively. Precise momentum-dependent band dispersions of $\alpha_1$, $\alpha_2$, and $\beta$ bands are shown in extended data [see Supplemental Material, Fig.~S1].
